Package: mcp-server-zabbix
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${python3:Depends},
 python3-fastmcp (>= 2.8.1),
 python3-zabbix-utils (>= 2.0.3),
 python3-dotenv (>= 1.0.0),
Recommends: mcprack-mcp-server-zabbix (= ${binary:Version})
Provides: zabbix-mcp-server
Replaces: zabbix-mcp-server (<< 2.0.1~)
Breaks: zabbix-mcp-server (<< 2.0.1~)
Description: Model Context Protocol server for Zabbix integration
 A comprehensive MCP server providing complete access to Zabbix API
 functionality through the Model Context Protocol, enabling AI assistants
 and other tools to interact with Zabbix monitoring systems.
 .
 Features include:
  * Host, item, trigger, template, and user management
  * Problem, event, and maintenance management
  * Historical data and trend retrieval
  * Proxy and host group management
  * Read-only mode for secure monitoring
  * Support for both STDIO and HTTP transports

Package: mcprack-mcp-server-zabbix
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 mcprack (>= 1.5.4),
 mcp-server-zabbix (= ${binary:Version}),
Description: Registers Zabbix MCP server into mcprack catalog
 Companion package for mcp-server-zabbix. Installing it registers
 the zabbix-mcp binary as an available MCP server in the local
 mcprack instance; removing it unregisters it again.
